WEBVTT

00:57.360 --> 01:00.240
I have dispatched troops to Wuse City

01:00.920 --> 01:03.080
and ordered Jiuying to accompany them

01:04.000 --> 01:07.560
to capture the High Priest and Helian Jie

01:08.039 --> 01:10.360
to vent the anger for Your Highness.

01:12.200 --> 01:13.730
No wonder he didn't show up.

01:14.080 --> 01:15.880
He went to Wuse City

01:16.000 --> 01:17.920
to capture people from the Helian clan.

01:17.920 --> 01:20.240
I have adopted him for years

01:20.600 --> 01:22.320
and taught him everything.

01:23.240 --> 01:25.000
If he dares to betray me,

01:25.560 --> 01:28.560
I will make him die without a burial place.

01:29.160 --> 01:30.400
He is now

01:31.080 --> 01:33.000
unable to protect himself.

01:34.000 --> 01:36.680
If you're waiting for him to come back and save you,

01:36.680 --> 01:38.240
you'll be waiting forever.

01:38.600 --> 01:40.600
Besides, you want my military tally

01:41.080 --> 01:43.759
just to get the military power of the Northern Frontier.

01:43.759 --> 01:44.920
But the Northern Frontier army

01:44.920 --> 01:47.720
cannot be mobilized by a mere tally.

01:48.039 --> 01:49.880
Without my order,

01:50.240 --> 01:53.039
no one will listen to you.

01:56.600 --> 01:58.400
Then will you listen to me?

02:04.040 --> 02:06.100
I heard there is a rumor in the capital

02:06.200 --> 02:09.320
that I abducted the Empress Dowager.

02:09.560 --> 02:11.520
A lie repeated often enough becomes the truth.

02:11.520 --> 02:13.080
I am truly wronged.

02:14.040 --> 02:16.000
I am utterly loyal.

02:16.480 --> 02:19.160
This is forcing me into rebellion.

02:20.600 --> 02:21.400
Your Grace,

02:21.960 --> 02:22.920
how about this?

02:23.240 --> 02:24.720
How about you marry me?

02:25.360 --> 02:27.440
These are the betrothal gifts.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.360
If you marry me,

02:29.680 --> 02:32.240
I will help you return to the capital to seize power.

02:32.240 --> 02:33.120
At that time,

02:33.320 --> 02:35.480
we can crown the Ninth Prince as the child emperor.

02:35.480 --> 02:36.680
You rule from behind the curtain.

02:36.680 --> 02:38.640
I will be the regent.

02:41.440 --> 02:42.300
Your Highness,

02:43.720 --> 02:44.920
what do you think?

02:46.880 --> 02:49.200
Men in this world are ridiculous.

02:50.079 --> 02:53.400
They always think they can control a woman with marriage.

02:54.360 --> 02:57.160
I didn't expect Baili Jinghong to be no exception.

03:04.840 --> 03:06.280
An eight-bearer sedan chair.

03:06.280 --> 03:07.440
A grand wedding.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.140
Proper etiquette.

03:09.280 --> 03:10.810
None of them can be missing.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.720
As Your Highness wishes.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.360
Hahaha.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.079
Why did you do this?

03:33.079 --> 03:34.760
Are you asking why he saved me,

03:36.800 --> 03:38.680
or why I saved you?

03:43.960 --> 03:45.400
He saved me out of love.

03:46.440 --> 03:48.900
I saved you because you are my older brother.

03:50.920 --> 03:52.200
That bitch Shen Lian,

03:52.800 --> 03:53.880
humiliated our father back then,

03:53.880 --> 03:55.810
and now is using you to threaten me.

03:56.440 --> 03:57.400
Impossible.

03:59.600 --> 04:01.120
Wake up, brother.

04:02.560 --> 04:06.820
Do you really think she suddenly found her conscience and treats you as a son?

04:08.520 --> 04:10.450
She's just using your background,

04:11.160 --> 04:12.820
and using my feelings for you.

04:13.080 --> 04:15.680
She threatened me to hand over gold to her every year,

04:15.680 --> 04:17.560
otherwise she would expose your Helian identity,

04:17.560 --> 04:19.519
leaving you nowhere to go.

04:21.800 --> 04:22.530
Impossible.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.960
Hahaha.

04:28.280 --> 04:30.880
Hahaha.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.960
Nothing is impossible.

04:33.960 --> 04:35.690
She thinks she's the smartest.

04:36.240 --> 04:37.840
She thinks I'll be manipulated by her.

04:37.840 --> 04:39.159
In her dreams.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.440
Brother,

04:42.640 --> 04:43.960
you are too naive.

04:44.760 --> 04:48.560
Why do you think the truth of the gold corruption case could never be found out?

04:48.560 --> 04:51.820
Do you really think this only has to do with Baili Jinghong?

04:52.200 --> 04:53.120
Let me tell you.

04:53.880 --> 04:55.159
Besides Shen Lian,

04:55.320 --> 04:56.680
there is the new emperor Ji Hongzhen,

04:56.680 --> 05:00.480
and countless vampires hiding in the shadows of the Great Yin court.

05:04.320 --> 05:05.600
Ji Hongzhen.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.200
Ji Hongzhen.

05:07.640 --> 05:09.200
He is really formidable.

05:10.000 --> 05:12.040
Watching us fight to the death,

05:12.040 --> 05:13.700
he enjoys the show in the dark.

05:14.960 --> 05:16.600
Now that I'm useless,

05:16.600 --> 05:18.120
he turns around and summons the imperial doctor away,

05:18.120 --> 05:19.760
to cut off my way to survive.

05:23.040 --> 05:24.840
Father was right.

05:25.800 --> 05:28.120
No one can save the Helian clan.

05:28.960 --> 05:30.400
No one.

05:31.800 --> 05:32.760
No one.

05:34.320 --> 05:35.159
You...

05:36.640 --> 05:38.640
You actually serve three masters.

05:40.040 --> 05:42.040
Who do I serve three masters for?

05:44.680 --> 05:45.880
You have your ways,

05:46.200 --> 05:47.760
and I have mine.

05:50.200 --> 05:52.080
Does father know?

05:52.080 --> 05:53.640
Do the clan elders know?

05:55.200 --> 05:56.000
Of course.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.800
Aman.

05:58.960 --> 06:00.690
Overusing the forbidden arts,

06:01.280 --> 06:03.520
will cause the clan members to die of exhaustion.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.320
You guys...

06:06.440 --> 06:07.720
So what?

06:08.960 --> 06:09.840
Brother,

06:10.960 --> 06:12.760
People are of high and low birth,

06:13.200 --> 06:15.130
and goods are of different grades.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.320
Dead is dead.

06:18.400 --> 06:21.200
There will always be living people to take their place.

06:21.200 --> 06:22.260
That's just great.

06:23.200 --> 06:24.520
How is this behavior

06:25.640 --> 06:28.900
any different from the court oppressing and enslaving us?

06:29.720 --> 06:32.120
You are the young master of the Helian clan.

06:33.760 --> 06:35.420
How can you be the same as them?

06:37.560 --> 06:38.520
Eldest Master.

06:40.960 --> 06:41.820
Eldest Master.

06:45.080 --> 06:46.000
Eldest Master,

06:46.000 --> 06:48.280
the general has mobilized troops to surround the Helian Manor,

06:48.280 --> 06:49.480
and Wuse City as well.

06:49.480 --> 06:51.760
He also ordered the arrest of all Helian clan members.

06:51.760 --> 06:53.360
I have dispatched the hidden army

06:53.360 --> 06:55.800
to escort all the citizens to a safe place.

06:56.280 --> 06:57.720
But the Northern Border Army has entered the city.

06:57.720 --> 06:59.440
It's only a matter of time before they are found.

06:59.440 --> 07:00.700
We can't wait anymore.

07:00.800 --> 07:01.930
Start the uprising.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.340
But your poison...

07:05.280 --> 07:06.760
I am cured of the poison.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.240
Mother.

07:12.600 --> 07:13.520
Mingyue.

07:13.960 --> 07:15.290
Wait for me to come back.

07:15.560 --> 07:17.000
You must wait for me.

07:39.040 --> 07:39.900
Your Highness.

07:44.200 --> 07:46.060
Are you really going to marry him?

07:50.800 --> 07:51.930
I need his soldiers,

07:52.520 --> 07:53.980
and the sooner the better.

07:55.040 --> 07:55.800
Otherwise,

07:56.040 --> 07:58.000
once Ji Hongzhen secures the throne,

07:58.000 --> 07:59.200
if I don't want to die,

08:00.440 --> 08:02.370
I'll be forced to be his plaything.

08:10.920 --> 08:12.320
But I refuse.

08:17.280 --> 08:18.140
Your Highness.

08:20.720 --> 08:21.650
The general said

08:21.720 --> 08:23.450
tomorrow is an auspicious day.

08:30.560 --> 08:31.600
Got it.

08:32.320 --> 08:33.760
If you don't like Wu Lie,

08:34.400 --> 08:35.440
from now on,

08:35.440 --> 08:37.159
just stay by my side.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.580
Thank you, Your Highness.

08:41.640 --> 08:42.679
Huo Lingyu.

08:43.919 --> 08:44.800
Tomorrow,

08:45.200 --> 08:47.660
I'll trouble you to escort me for my wedding.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.600
Brother.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.640
I didn't expect you to hide

09:54.640 --> 09:57.040
so many trusted aides in the Northern Army.

09:58.360 --> 10:01.760
The Dayin royal family has bullied our Helian clan for years.

10:03.760 --> 10:05.080
Over the years,

10:06.880 --> 10:11.080
I've also gathered evidence of officials forming self-serving factions.

10:12.000 --> 10:13.860
With us brothers joining forces,

10:14.640 --> 10:16.560
we'll completely overthrow

10:17.320 --> 10:18.520
Dayin.

10:33.880 --> 10:35.080
Eldest Young Master.

10:35.240 --> 10:35.880
Bad news.

10:37.080 --> 10:38.640
The Empress Dowager is marrying Baili Jinghong.

10:38.640 --> 10:40.200
The wedding is tomorrow.

10:47.040 --> 10:47.960
Brother.

10:54.560 --> 10:57.680
I've done everything I should.

10:58.160 --> 10:59.480
Now that you are dead,

10:59.960 --> 11:04.000
I have no reason to stay in the Helian clan.

11:41.960 --> 11:42.760
Huo Lingyu.

11:43.640 --> 11:44.560
I didn't expect

11:44.920 --> 11:46.250
you to have such a skill.

11:46.680 --> 11:48.680
My mother loved painting her nails,

11:49.000 --> 11:50.800
but she didn't like nail polish.

11:52.520 --> 11:55.380
She preferred using crushed impatiens to dye them.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.960
The servants were careless

11:57.960 --> 12:00.240
and always got the flower paste outside her nails,

12:00.240 --> 12:01.840
which made her angry and cry.

12:03.560 --> 12:05.560
I couldn't bear to see my mother sad,

12:06.400 --> 12:07.730
so I learned to help her.

12:11.240 --> 12:12.840
I couldn't save your mother.

12:14.560 --> 12:15.880
I'm sorry.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.960
You already tried your best.

12:35.400 --> 12:37.080
Today is truly a joyous day.

12:40.200 --> 12:41.840
We finally get to attend the General's wedding banquet.

12:41.840 --> 12:42.880
Isn't it?

12:46.200 --> 12:47.640
It's the General's wedding.

12:47.640 --> 12:49.280
Why hasn't the Young General shown up?

12:49.280 --> 12:50.280
He went to patrol the border.

12:50.280 --> 12:51.540
He should be back soon.

12:52.640 --> 12:53.840
I doubt he'll be back.

12:54.040 --> 12:57.500
I heard the Empress Dowager is quite fond of the Young General.

12:57.800 --> 12:58.920
The General was furious,

12:58.920 --> 12:59.920
so...

13:01.400 --> 13:02.720
Move the boxes inside.

13:02.920 --> 13:03.850
Watch your step.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.920
Everything is ready.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.280
So beautiful.

13:47.480 --> 13:48.280
Your Majesty.

13:49.960 --> 13:51.820
The auspicious hour has arrived.

14:11.200 --> 14:13.080
The auspicious hour has arrived.

14:13.080 --> 14:15.400
Bring in the bride and groom.

14:24.880 --> 14:29.040
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

14:33.360 --> 14:36.080
Second bow to parents.

14:44.360 --> 14:46.560
Husband and wife bow to each other.

14:52.880 --> 14:54.440
Ceremony complete.

14:54.680 --> 14:56.160
Congratulations, General.

14:56.160 --> 14:58.000
Congratulations, General.

14:58.800 --> 15:00.520
Congratulations, General.

15:01.160 --> 15:02.320
Today

15:03.360 --> 15:05.840
is my, Baili Jinghong's, wedding day.

15:06.240 --> 15:07.800
I also announce to you all,

15:08.400 --> 15:11.800
that the traitor Ji Hongzhen usurped the throne.

15:12.640 --> 15:13.800
The late Emperor

15:14.680 --> 15:16.610
left another edict of succession,

15:16.800 --> 15:18.530
which is in the hands of my wife,

15:19.040 --> 15:22.360
the Empress Dowager.

15:23.120 --> 15:24.400
After tomorrow,

15:25.400 --> 15:26.960
our Northern Army

15:27.760 --> 15:30.680
will pick a date to march to the capital

15:31.440 --> 15:32.960
to restore order.

15:33.400 --> 15:43.640
To restore order!

15:44.160 --> 15:46.600
Escort them to the bridal chamber.

15:46.600 --> 15:49.000
Great.

16:05.280 --> 16:07.320
Great.

16:08.160 --> 16:10.160
Great.

16:11.680 --> 16:13.680
Great.

16:14.680 --> 16:16.680
Hahaha.

16:17.360 --> 16:18.360
Great.
